    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Isekai\u2019d</i> is an anime-style open-world RPG with up to 4-player co-op. Name your party and make it known across the world by rising through the guild ranks to become S-rank adventurers. Defeat bosses, complete quests, explore dungeons and make choices that <strong>actually</strong> shape the world around you and its fate. With the looming threat of the Demon Lord\u2019s return, will your party stop him, join him, become demon lords yourselves, or carve a different path entirely?</p>",
